  "translation": "Antap long maunten i antap tru, yu ken go antap, meri i autim gutpela nius long Tsiyon; kirapim vol bilong yu long strongpela, meri i autim gutpela nius long Yerusalayim; kirapim, no ken pret; tokim ol sit bilong Yuda: Lukim, Elohim bilong yupela!",
